    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "ふむふむ。ではその件はまさに\r\n『隣のダートは力強く見える』ですね！",
            "enText": "I see, so it's like the saying goes, \"the dirt is\nalways stronger on the other side\".",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 2003353266159289457,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "おおっ、チヨノオーさん。\r\nその言葉は……。",
            "enText": "Whoa, Chiyono. Nice proverb!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 8486863703239235653,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "はいっ、チヨノートにまとめている\r\n格言です。日々の気づきを活かすことこそ、\n次の成長につながると思いまして！",
            "enText": "Yeah! I write sayings in my Chiyonotes.\nThe little insights I have every day might\nbe useful someday!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 7920601925920822510,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "……。",
            "enText": "…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 2140939520905968879,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "バクシンオーさん？",
            "enText": "Bakushin O?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 335601426243419471,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "『スピードとはすなわち速さ』である！",
            "enText": "\"Speed comes down to velocity!\"",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 2702265091747485094,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "ふふん、私の格言です。\r\nどうぞ新たに書き留めてください。",
            "enText": "Heh, that's my proverb. Feel free to write\nthat one down.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 1196897670185753480,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "わぁっ、ありがとうございま……あれ？\r\nスピードと速さは同じ意味では？",
            "enText": "Ooh, thank… Wait. Don't speed and velocity\nmean the same thing?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 963073418706388797,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラバクシンオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Bakushin O",
            "jpText": "違います！\r\nスピードはトレーニングして得るもの、\n速さとは自らを鍛えて得るものです！",
            "enText": "Nope! Speed is what you gain from training.\nVelocity, you have to work up to through\nexercise!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -321298055381586316,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "……！　なるほど、早速メモしておきます！\r\n『スピードとは』……。",
            "enText": "I see! I'd better write that down! \"Speed is…\"",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 252106270956898302,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "あれ？　トレーニングも鍛えるも\r\n同じ意味のような……？",
            "enText": "Huh? I feel like training and exercise\nalso mean the same thing here…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -7821187882504642097,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
    ],
